WEBVTT

00:07:28.472 --> 00:07:31.204
that is my grandparents, by the way,

00:07:31.228 --> 00:07:32.943
they're the people that raised me,

00:07:32.967 --> 00:07:34.323
and there I am --

00:07:34.347 --> 00:07:35.348
(Laughs)

00:07:35.372 --> 00:07:40.834
(Applause)

00:07:40.858 --> 00:07:43.611
So I've been put on private jets,
flown around the world,

00:07:43.635 --> 00:07:45.700
and yet, it's not been that easy

00:07:45.724 --> 00:07:48.796
because at times, I've been homeless,

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.182
I've been spat at,

00:07:50.206 --> 00:07:52.096
I've been abused, sometimes daily,

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:54.008
bullied my entire life,

00:07:54.032 --> 00:07:56.494
rejected by countless individuals,

00:07:56.518 --> 00:07:58.404
and I've been stabbed.

00:07:58.428 --> 00:08:00.334
But what hurt the most